Type: Package
Package: LLMRpanel
Title: Calibrated Silicon Samples for Survey and Experiment Design
Version: 0.6.0
Authors@R:
    person("Ali", "Sanaei", , "sanaei@uchicago.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Survey and experimental instruments administered to panels of
  language model personas, for the design stage of human studies, built on
  'LLMR'. Every result prints as uncalibrated until it is compared with a
  human benchmark; silicon sampling here pretests instruments and designs
  rather than estimating populations.
